{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Maria, since we talked, it's been tough. My old area was hit by a nasty flood last week. The infrastructure wasn't great so lots of homes were ruined. It's reminding me we need to fix things up in our community."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-f85bfd3ba4b1b5642a9f82a3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:52:32.756679+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f85bfd3ba4b1b5642a9f82a3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f85bfd3ba4b1b5642a9f82a3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sorry to hear about what happened in your area, John. That must have been tough for you and everyone there. Is there anything I can do to help?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-45e697b7fb7a0c8284237859", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:52:36.907766+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "45e697b7fb7a0c8284237859", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "45e697b7fb7a0c8284237859", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks a lot, Maria. Your offer means a lot to me. I'm getting people together to chat about this and discuss potential solutions. I'd really appreciate your thoughts."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-f0f3bd7f4c8aa28a11bbac8d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:52:41.059116+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f0f3bd7f4c8aa28a11bbac8d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f0f3bd7f4c8aa28a11bbac8d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, I'm down to join the meeting and contribute to making our community better. Let's do this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-f290d29d31ae69c804c0f25e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:52:45.146500+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f290d29d31ae69c804c0f25e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f290d29d31ae69c804c0f25e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Nice work, Maria! Your determination never ceases to amaze me. Let's get to work!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-f77726d009d73e52d5e67a8e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:52:49.261157+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f77726d009d73e52d5e67a8e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f77726d009d73e52d5e67a8e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Definitely, John! Your commitment to helping others is inspiring. It's great to have a friend like you who shares the same passion. Let's join forces and make the change we desire in our community."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-fe00f49101f5fb4eff273f4c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:52:53.373469+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fe00f49101f5fb4eff273f4c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fe00f49101f5fb4eff273f4c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That means a lot, Maria. Your support and friendship mean everything. Together, we can really make a difference and motivate others too. Let's keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-625453fb182ab2cbf5c57b3d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:52:57.518592+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "625453fb182ab2cbf5c57b3d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "625453fb182ab2cbf5c57b3d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: John, let's keep working together to make a difference in our community. Our actions, no matter how small, can have a big impact. Let's continue to spread kindness and inspire hope."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-e241bcd50b4b7e67114ac788", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:53:01.663699+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e241bcd50b4b7e67114ac788", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e241bcd50b4b7e67114ac788", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Definitely, little steps count! We can really make a difference together - let's do it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-55e8e5827fabd086de9ac7f3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:53:05.792796+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "55e8e5827fabd086de9ac7f3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "55e8e5827fabd086de9ac7f3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yep, let's create a positivity ripple! Little acts of kindness and helping hands can really transform lives. Let's keep improving our community."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-1ca043b2b9822f3593ce9eff", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:53:09.894957+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1ca043b2b9822f3593ce9eff", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1ca043b2b9822f3593ce9eff", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, let's work hard to help those around us. We can make a difference!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-28d54f46e106293d8307097d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:53:14.042161+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "28d54f46e106293d8307097d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "28d54f46e106293d8307097d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, John! Change starts small, so with hard work, we can really make something great. I'm glad to have you here."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-2ce85c0d6c2630bb7fcb624a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:53:18.160033+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2ce85c0d6c2630bb7fcb624a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2ce85c0d6c2630bb7fcb624a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria. Your support means a lot and it's awesome to have you by my side in our community work. Let's keep going and making great things happen!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-d77d939d20e63c1d1b22a06c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:53:22.329569+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d77d939d20e63c1d1b22a06c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d77d939d20e63c1d1b22a06c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: For sure! We can keep doing great stuff and making a difference. Well, I'm off to have dinner with some friends from the gym. Talk to you later!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_23-0da425dce646076cfbf91793", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:53:26.482812+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0da425dce646076cfbf91793", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0da425dce646076cfbf91793", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
